{"availability":"available","full":"mirzayasirabdullahbaig07/AURA-Alpaca-AI-Project","name":"AURA-Alpaca-AI-Project","description":"AI agents are increasingly given real-world power — moving money, executing trades, taking actions with no human in the loop. But autonomy without accountability is dangerous. Most autonomous systems are black boxes: they act, but they can't explain why, and nothing stops a confident-but-wrong model from causing real damage.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":23,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-24T15:13:36Z","updated":"2026-08-24T15:53:22Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aura-alpaca-ai-project.streamlit.app/","topics":["agents","ai","coding","deeplearning","deployments","generative-ai","hackathons","langchain","langgraph","python","streamlit","system-design"],"demo":"https://aura-alpaca-ai-project.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:57:50.290Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:57:50.290Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:57:50.290Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:01.338Z","stars":23,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:00.980Z","stars":23,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:28:47.215Z","stars":23,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:57:50.290Z","stars":23,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Autonomous trading you can actually audit — the AI proposes, a deterministic risk engine disposes."],"features":["Adversarial self-critique — the AI argues against its own trades before acting.","Deterministic risk governance — hard limits (exposure, position size, risk/reward, confidence) enforced in code, not by the model.","Risk-aware position sizing — every trade risks a fixed % of the portfolio, not a flat dollar amount.","Full decision trace — every decision (taken or refused) is logged and replayable as an execution log.","Autonomous cycle — one command scans a watchlist, runs the full chain per symbol, enforces risk, and executes."],"so